      "hash": "e22820fcf5cd90e3fdd99a7569e0ee2f30eb7ebadfb2fe4d159b30c166ff81b7"
    },
    {
      "id": "b6d47d1671ae5972a318b8ea54c2a84eebfd267a8a28408503104795c5613cf0",
      "text": "3 min read",
      "hash": "3ddda92ca6c1c4477116381599bb4d74d6d81b636b0c81868090aa5a475c93e8"
    },
    {
      "id": "a72696f07bb9afb0ebd6b06a9e6528b386fb108a6fad853af87ee77b602edd56",
      "text": "This Hook Stops Claude Code Running Dangerous Git Commands",
      "hash": "bece2dfa71670e0dba50ef01a35087b4bfd34004db429177a1d484837dc5ee9d"
    },
    {
      "id": "7d0e8c675da6e8236e137f859063c81cf42fa9f99540807b20d44b2a08e95430",
      "text": "Learn how to block dangerous git commands in Claude Code using a PreToolUse hook. Prevent accidental data loss with git guardrails.",
      "hash": "8184b4752dcf4e1adeda4aca08c0c363db688429d5c9f1859c33323295a27f87"
    },
    {
      "id": "3f6dddcdb11ca41b8cd3197cc3364887e183dd5937bcab70419329469ceefe0c",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "2b23f9a47f219ad446203a62a1142e5072755b76cc657ed2cfa9e5d5273d7af8",
      "text": "Subscribe",
      "hash": "cc0e38da9c41790bffef1b88af32d39ac285edce93da766810edc237cb2f1625"
    },
    {
      "id": "e1d5eb44a85abf4be56400727f51e9e95332664f5cc538fee43c71fc951a4cf4",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "12ee31a0ffecca8ee84bdcb76201e62549a14ab45ccebb1d2869bf5d255cc165",
      "text": "Share",
      "hash": "29887a5ff9846ccc23327565a07e17fa6dcaea6211f1898ae825f84ae38f4223"
    },
    {
      "id": "4a2f0c58ced6edf2b0469ab2346f3875a72fc25256f931fade2a06fdec6cc242",
      "text": "On this page",
      "hash": "b5658fc8edda24f9c94eabac9e536e0a18e3055a8ca255f9d1b8f256ea02a6cc"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5d1ea4eb83945a0a6a759bf2c0de6925855eeb632d2cc358065ea24261a26bb",
      "text": "Why This Skill Exists",
      "hash": "3427a504f888644dd9e3718de7d422bab3b830b8badd1abd6d09c97bfe660d97"
    },
    {
      "id": "fbffa8ba423ef6bed539d2a609fa3418059c301574c2c9f90a0d4cfedac9af8d",
      "text": "What Gets Blocked",
      "hash": "cb146e4c41d1447e56fbb7c76ea823f59bc8f5356a50be17fb49dea387893687"
    },
    {
      "id": "88b301a94ecd8d67f9237212e6fab632a05907acaf27f9af09c1b408d1341b3f",
      "text": "How It Works: The Hook System",
      "hash": "8a5de3d23a9661a933d27580ec7208bfff83bec91f14a693bc94d40e28515e35"
    },
    {
      "id": "842b209593e196248cd97c334a82c837c27198a162af1a1bab3b8335343c16b8",
      "text": "Verify It's Working",
      "hash": "49011aae69cfcff06260e89463fa674404d882ac9fd13f581dc00d40ef552fc1"
    },
    {
      "id": "4941a12e044047c89ba4ab1cdf81a7a9c877f0ff5dce16c13219272999b75da8",
      "text": "Conclusion",
      "hash": "89db2ad881f29c18b305a20c8ed7bdffdfde49d633c27a83bd204bf9cfedaba3"
    },
    {
      "id": "46a3188aa4fd8c0035b287b878057ccfc6ccaf87c6bc3df16bd0089e2257aa9e",
      "text": "Related reading",
      "hash": "89c21c36ad5ffbab7b05ced367c46013c8d7b8ddf53a8b9739b7b2545f78abee"
    },
    {
      "id": "7834f7d756a7db085e0bb0e82f30bbd619102a6c747c5182f0ee5ec0f4cc1401",
      "text": "I've put together a skill to allow you to prevent Claude code from ever running dangerous git commands. Add it via",
      "hash": "1a20d1184c5fbe4f41ab5ac2d9895d28d42ecee4e4c25be186257f555b419204"
    },
    {
      "id": "16b5e4d462c65506b5f78b67d6ff49f75c5c40c1be290731b99662ee6afb66b7",
      "text": "Claude will guide you through the setup - choose whether to install it for your current project or globally across all projects, then customize which git commands you want to block.",
      "hash": "91bf3b952afffac8dc7760191b85aa8ab52fb6d106335136320ea6feffcc38c9"
    },
    {
      "id": "313cf88f9f8edb9aea61606d0feff3279bbcf2622a2518f03b8908b5eed52c55",
      "text": "The Docker Sandbox Story",
      "hash": "797cc099d762332c40f98c78db4db952f2665acc99d17762a69b1e7a50247cd9"
    },
    {
      "id": "119a1ea64b639fc8a9bcbb740dbf1efa4a741268e287bbfac6d3e210dd7410cc",
      "text": "I've been experimenting with",
      "hash": "44ba226c1bbc1e872015c24b8ecc96a6ed2c49a211eba1215e6641dade13d086"
    },
    {
      "id": "ff613d006a7bf0007183d52dd364710fbdd4d20ba87dcf6b36caaf1c89a5e519",
      "text": "Ralph-style workflows",
      "hash": "f08a3a4f3c82847ff53145e0622c35ce1734052572e4845330de4b8757f41a89"
    },
    {
      "id": "156bdb0c0e1e551aac7f13720a6f2c95a6e0622c5763d07da4674947c066a00c",
      "text": "recently, and the most powerful way I've found to get Claude to run autonomously is via",
      "hash": "fd4bdd4dd2f3eec7f5ac91c5527f46ed52a33f4934a20ef7c25a88fbc527dce0"
    },
    {
      "id": "477a978fe5560e7165a23c848aa41a992061174556c33bc10a7a886a5abd05e2",
      "text": "Docker Sandbox",
      "hash": "693b2e7ce66631b6b96aeb84a43d6f144dbe896d7bd54c3dee56820ea47a9880"
    },
    {
      "id": "e9dec76ca067404f114e4ddc948ae3a8f9b0dcee29cef221292333d38201a9cd",
      "text": "It lets Claude Code run in YOLO without asking permission for every command. And it protects your system by running it inside a microVM. You can let your agent work unattended while you check in every few minutes.",
      "hash": "06ed19d52977d0ff68649abbdc47ae98e821961fb2435af81aaca27de20a87cb"
    },
    {
      "id": "a081ce5389d04b1265df8f7647dbe2ab301d01218b981ce7b0161b2012ca7f82",
      "text": "The tradeoff? Docker",
      "hash": "b4fe5edc1af077661ff1872099c8af8bab070f7b9dcf6aa31f4fc1aecd9f734d"
    },
    {
      "id": "fa5dacb7271ffcf97eefeb79e8bf7556f3d156ae9e084f30c30562392e18b07b",
      "text": "Sandbox",
      "hash": "67fc62497e85d81bc54ea07aa87dca6868cd470e95d7281155a8eb532ce60009"
    },
    {
      "id": "b36ff09a83582871b006b654f3a1ef52698a8b1d58ddd95986390c954970a06a",
      "text": "doesn't restrict",
      "hash": "b3ceb377798278349fb44cbab4417587dc652a105e3641daf5698b234333afdb"
    },
    {
      "id": "4fc6bc5297bf996d6b86ccd926eedba72ef9400f543f2ac73391c3ababd54cfc",
      "text": "commands Claude can run, it just isolates",
      "hash": "572ac0b952b619765e03a508c08785991e2c94b45f731f2799b913e6c12565b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "27a674266980655d63647ca5868a5a0ccacd43ec26cdf9612a3337ac1b3fadc4",
      "text": "they run.",
      "hash": "6926282d238cf1a0df24e392340aa3edbf42c8f7fd32234c274215941cca3878"
    },
    {
      "id": "c5e8cf8485057308f8f39dbcc885b0165e4eed9a313499f7ede15b5c5bc17df5",
      "text": "The Gap Docker Sandbox Leaves",
      "hash": "d2a08eccd87a64f0a17ebd28b9fb6d9063aa7e619f1c7bbad6dee20489fea072"
    },
    {
      "id": "4470a294da759d44569a6eb77628a71b41bd714f01be905029ae9eef3bb59eaf",
      "text": "Here's the problem: your git history lives inside that sandboxed folder.",
      "hash": "9fa66d09a80a95e34261debb583d5757a3211eaf79972c2b60ccc3180381bebe"
    },
    {
      "id": "9ef50f3fd5534a200481ba3a5808f55200cf00d9e158550d71746f97b813939c",
      "text": "Docker Sandbox prevents Claude from reaching outside the project directory, but it can't stop Claude from running destructive git commands",
      "hash": "e654ab2690d0ef9d5c46e55b0e8d7980e8091e5ceb9201ac001f6032bb021800"
    },
    {
      "id": "0810c6ef747700692cc9a60f3971ea41dfb3df10d66acc3c28345b0c60153cc6",
      "text": "that directory. A single",
      "hash": "b548f02b643147080cabcde120296cf472c8bc585469c2f146ccd0760f788505"
    },
    {
      "id": "069a29816a7d98778568f7e48f2c08834ceaf4eae89f1d54cfae6cf6d4b6d11d",
      "text": "can wipe out weeks of work.",
      "hash": "d4b280c8026f6e1c708f0acd701f76550ec06acb3daf15bc70dc135680d21e2c"
    },
    {
      "id": "b1bbeec98761435c9f9daa634d4338a6b256d6388fcb6e4a3af7573aff49cc53",
      "text": "This skill fills that gap with a hard guardrail - preventing Claude Code from running dangerous commands.",
      "hash": "bc45c368994d3912d71b77366d1b32fa89ae7b628c0d374d0de946580ca16aab"
    },
    {
      "id": "e757012f0383483c4f4f4ebe3f69656d1200170441f2b09a5036e8748a5a6b09",
      "text": "Go deeper:",
      "hash": "15ad3d88c6733d9b257c322d3afecc9bce2b18558171007db87598c118ca17f9"
    },
    {
      "id": "afc2eeb84ad7f10f54f5db28cb7e57d846b4d765f05783ee095d881eb3fa9e58",
      "text": "join the waitlist for AI Coding for Real Engineers",
      "hash": "16c3492a8464a0859c944e287a9d433e9a2635f22a6bd8aad59f88c3e80ab732"
    },
    {
      "id": "f112295f6c6516845aac0d481ec4ebd3aa4f75f334c9dab78573e67a37ff59d5",
      "text": "The skill blocks these dangerous patterns by default:",
      "hash": "f534bdff64b06344bba28c62f972347aaf3282f530f4eecf3691ddbdffacf4df"
    },
    {
      "id": "2f803ddb851768a5ab4fb3eafe503809a9d328e381477ee4a6aa6ec6d4e04c62",
      "text": "(all variants, including",
      "hash": "97ba545a5f5dc770fc8ad4d52b9b46dda5909c41deca6824e43e3cd57be7f68e"
    },
    {
      "id": "bb25e7f9c6dcbb58c30918ba8f29176f8c391146b706097150a7f325f6b3d6ce",
      "text": "These aren't \"never allow\" rules, they're \"safe by default\" rules.",
      "hash": "b02d6b5ef05d22a9f59ec1353a0a0e080401e787f6063e374c46906934fc1a03"
    },
    {
      "id": "e296e22f3ba9e2eb34f6972e33f2f0e979b1b82ccaf6673155d90aa0408ea699",
      "text": "You can customize the blocked patterns during installation, or edit them anytime. If your workflow legitimately needs Claude to push to a remote PR, you can allow it.",
      "hash": "a10df8d786acd014276498e38d4c6d47fad0ed003b10b8ec1ba0df41dd11e219"
    },
    {
      "id": "c2923141adc73a2bddd15c250d82cf811c97c13f58eab1d27e785d5e1c2ae937",
      "text": "The skill uses a",
      "hash": "82d8d789aa660303a952585c236c21c48ac374b0334071f876e10d5ef54e7eb1"
    },
    {
      "id": "093e477c0278421b89b1b32878485082a470539162b85edf3f0d2fd787a516fd",
      "text": "hook that intercepts bash commands before Claude executes them.",
      "hash": "a59e2e55abba465aadd3cbc2f00aba7ec8566dacfd36b3fe8fba9827b43fc364"
    },
    {
      "id": "6d6a9a1540483cdd42d445ee6d69bb3abc2e36f632ff42511e7c98a2cde56583",
      "text": "Here's the filtering script:",
      "hash": "cc387249e7d2410ccc34417a903c695410c83ed97c0ad7d55ea114792cc7b6cc"
    },
    {
      "id": "f6572b0f242ae85e6c35bddac4a1b58337c47015600fdbe5114a5f4dc31f3d7a",
      "text": "The script reads the incoming command, checks it against the danger list, and blocks execution if it matches.",
      "hash": "fcd4313e77193b63109508d48cbddd3d588ac6fd21b1f20b6c44ffc3f047fbf0"
    },
    {
      "id": "084fc2cdc5a076d4466c74465328b6b5818a7c4c36f27b178d18366850e5622b",
      "text": "What Claude Sees",
      "hash": "e84fee6aeddd3fb08fcf951fb589397f7e9998ee4f9c6af7f5a5a7e68af58bab"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0760eec1b8323287bc68cb03989d537fcb8fd17e5a8c4d5b23abdb30f4381e8",
      "text": "When Claude tries to run a blocked command, it sees a clear message:",
      "hash": "7493d226ebec4bfdb3ed67b9c24b5033c9750cbf882c1a368843e7372a84b4a2"
    },
    {
      "id": "40bbcf012a8f078086b1bf7e543d2b70b9bdc08f26cfbe4088ca89466df316a2",
      "text": "Claude understands the constraint and adapts. It's a hard guardrail, not a suggestion buried in prose.",
      "hash": "72aac17a9c142974e40bb5fc9a7dc4dd3f7fa6f9df162a884d6e76dd67813e5d"
    },
    {
      "id": "f43c1b88bd36251e9cc586d9b961fae9b0c3ee1171450e371478bc1c3a47034c",
      "text": "After installation, test the guardrail:",
      "hash": "34937a1f0c5a5d72f712bfb4d2826e07a4593faf46f75a0567c54e159afb98ac"
    },
    {
      "id": "ec3f0121d3edbd57f6562b9b3397b415102b9421e8a1cdbba3fdf9d6d9ecb335",
      "text": "Clear your conversation context",
      "hash": "194eee8b6dc0231876ef41d1b1015071bc62b419a4ea037f90e90d8716ca5627"
    },
    {
      "id": "edadf3f039a4857c1461e99e196dbb7aa7ccc28c7245994073c677572b89fffb",
      "text": "Ask Claude to run",
      "hash": "a050fb8957a37924a7a69d49422ee1a406b89c4074e32bc69248bca726034a60"
    },
    {
      "id": "f33b16b257bfa4d0be780625a428d3f48139ab2540a6c62fe5b8fe36f886c693",
      "text": "Watch it fail and see the blocked message",
      "hash": "4b2f144dacc9500124de1678a956917afc5edc73709e97981fa10d90304a9f88"
    },
    {
      "id": "3e9fd6e7c86545f3820481700f5179e79624ab5ee3ffd0de2c2e429ae7ed7e0f",
      "text": "This confirms the hook is active and Claude can't accidentally bypass it.",
      "hash": "5e7a5e7f7c0a602a31e6e0ced5210d5cc77a762298fd0f3207a40142383cdea5"
    },
    {
      "id": "fcc090d4cd0c4078810a248d7f42c4171153f69e2b0dcab8c2434e31c8f57fc7",
      "text": "Enjoy! These kinds of skills are great fun to put together, and if you're looking for more of them, join my newsletter.",
      "hash": "e46851490259f74a2b81eeb746163422a29d3744760d155879f9803541bd90dc"
    },
    {
      "id": "d119c4934a01272d25c144ededa5cf14ee181196e7b6c16ab27043d3885028b4",
      "text": "Share on X",
      "hash": "78d21bbf6b047944ec42890d28e151c61dbab35213fc65cc7be70c0c19c24407"
    },
    {
      "id": "2015a6aaa8a8f814114c26d70928ae60133e17597f62a211ae182dad91563e90",
      "text": "Share on Bluesky",
